  "prefLabel": "Phy 200 PROCEDURAL RULES",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Phy 200 PROCEDURAL RULES\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #12993, effective 2-22-20, repealed all of the former rules in Chapter Phy 200 and adopted a new rule Phy 201 titled “Applicability of Ahp 200” containing Phy 201.01 titled “Rules of Practice and Procedure.”\n\nDocument #12993 replaced all prior filings for the former Chapter Phy 200. The prior filings affecting the former Chapter Phy 200 included the following documents:\n\n#9040, eff 11-28-07\n\n#9041, eff 11-28-07, EXPIRED 11-28-15 (in Phy 202, 214, 218 and 219)\n\n#10201, eff 10-29-12\n\nAs practice and procedure rules, the rules in Chapter Phy 200 in Document #12993 will not expire except pursuant to RSA 541-A:17, II.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/phy200.html"
